== system ord
refused unsupported-profile: `(adapter deadline-over-delay timer.d (task ord a))` delivers an expiry to `(task ord a)`; `(task ord b)` programs an alarm at `timer.d` itself: no context runs a job's code in an interrupt, and how a job receives an alarm it programs itself or an expiry, and what the system's own level's requirement for either means, are `M4.1.6`'s
